      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3365d13f7b7ffbc20cafacea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛最终盘的前段\n若正处于最后冲刺阶段则\n速度稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "94e910b37c51998588f36012fc92e9d158d15f13d03238d81992c185b9fc15b6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210382"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca986d1aef99df1608e1baa9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛最终阶段开始时\\n若处于最后冲刺中则提升速度\\n获得的总气氛Pt越高\\n则效果提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba176a750d6dc04483ae7f7311f7072daebf8e6ffacb12e17d5217cf51239ad3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210391"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4927654fe48aa93a6f417f32",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛最终阶段开始时\\n若处于最后冲刺中\\n则速度稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "88c2862566c07fadd58ba74624b42773c4f6dcc1988992805be822b02b846152",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210392"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afa692dded295c31e57b7437",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对胜利的渴望正熊熊燃烧\\n使得能力值略微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "d204f520cdcdd945dbde8ac6b52647906782ad105b4c6370c2e1d5d7b9f2d170",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:508e24a6118b27103e2c1f07",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即便时过境迁,无法使用原先的跑法\\n但对胜利的渴望永不改变\\n使得能力值大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5e688099e81845bf8da72b403f55b1a0d26b5eb541e4ccefd922e806e78361d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c26220ae38b3bb9c89d3b1ba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想要全力目睹梦中的景色\\n能力值略微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "021d3c20b3514fccf0ca3f7cfd20f8d0f44091b00bafc64d3078396ba720f178",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ced23a81563773798dd61236",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "被训练员的不安所侵染\\n稍微难以发挥能力",
      "source_fingerprint": "4460037d2be7db0a21152241deb4356b8feb5b1b34e61c38e185ab0e5bbd4ed6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7333dce67f3eb80305b4c364",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员的不安化为实体\\n在比赛后段的弯道上\\n速度极大量下降",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ddc3d5284c43a04508cca3c9246d977ac7cf043f5530a4b6202754de2bce33e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0656b0d57d260c239aa6c8f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "承载着众人的心愿\\n想要率先冲线的愿望愈加强烈\\n在最终直线上速度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ad9f774a04ef15dfae4cb2a4dd78087bf451eed93c84207fc823c91543a2975",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6f0476a14e03e00c2834d43",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "向无声铃鹿传达\\n看到全新舞台的期望\\n让她更好的发挥自己的能力",
      "source_fingerprint": "67f9a0276826f7866326c2dd8efcb345f50804acaeea8f4ec3af2cc58b51cbaf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6087a040a9468bf10d113ef6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "向无声铃鹿施下\\n能够畅快奔跑的魔咒\\n让她更好的发挥自己的能力",
      "source_fingerprint": "53d72ac81742037a6934fc2a7a7f7327693179139929bcb807fcb8e2333c1ba8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300081"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a4e6500ea3e1eab83500d68",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿终于找到独属于自己的跑法\\n并将之化为对亲友的激励\\n无声铃鹿的能力能更好地发挥",
      "source_fingerprint": "38095beabdae8748731cbcb2410c40ccdfb3859d394868eab9daf3a214a24ae3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9066308a208ef06e33b7aed7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后段的弯道上\\n无声铃鹿感受到众人的祈愿\\n因此恢复耐力",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b60014a40b7b4b318d6489ee81e0c647648223980116d6a2856602a3250be50",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97fea3c7654876804c5e18dd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "朝着日本第一的赛马娘又近了一步\\n因此稍微更能发挥自己的实力",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce854ed7f8b339172d1b186358f43aa54f15b1309078b6304d9fed53cc485107",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eed20a3623d45a25a09c4a12",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这场比赛承载着队伍全员的心愿\\n对胜利的渴望正愈发强烈\\n因此极大幅提升能力值",
      "source_fingerprint": "f86b7d54dc8eee0f89f61565f1238ce70aacdc0500d7773a332f356957669b8a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73619f6b2f9f04e8e79de783",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不遗余力,全力交锋！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e437460f05b6113a737bd1e1b5fb2ceafea654b5ec91ba57b447ea9350d007f2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81e4184a44ba68b9ab04d741",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一决胜负,恕请赐教！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41814b8475e34bbd91951f96892977fa09ec601d02cd05f24e795eb0cce5b378",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300141"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf4523b7cb8c7abf16020e64",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "受到盒中的压抑影响\\n能力绝望性地难以发挥",
      "source_fingerprint": "d57873211e528bf9e690fd74387230b97a611267b438ab09dd4dd289aa622603",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300151"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fced128669b6978ca0271b6b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "积极的心态变得模糊\\n比赛终盘加速度绝望性下降",
      "source_fingerprint": "e73ae3b5fe317d70fe447a6b84464f5f5333fe3424d12ac795f94ae2cc9cdf33",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "300161"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf40d4d884ce318aeef8b5d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘时\\n速度大幅提升＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bc8e2bff8b9fe232257693525436e2e9fba12718aaf2073bb4e3b6e35abd80d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "407011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84647a455167094855858707",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "中盘超越对手后\\n速度大幅提升＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a7298ec71c2b427f6bef9d6e5df43c4e542965605f3997ba7a2fcefdf7a4042",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "407021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79e4fd1a8de525ef6e4444a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终冲刺的关键时刻\\n速度大幅提升＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b92f6e9eeeeae41089229191221cebebfeb651cfdb156258f9334705e8ba1af9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "407031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fb611e6eb11f161d909324d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘时若自身位于队伍中间往前\\n则速度大幅提升\\n＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "60dc4c8f9264e0a3a97494437c4d747dfd681e027234e1ffabf9811cdb911455",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "407041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9701b790e6bce76b53a4641e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道处若自身位于中后方\\n则速度大幅提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "2815880789139d8aedf612fb4df64e505f73efb75f3db5f72e69da0e536f5fcf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "407051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4a19dd8e6f4fd1ff9e5cb9b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘自身若位于队伍中间往前\\n则速度大幅提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f0ca79f123ad7a144c31e0e183eff4169bc0d5383f9bec3a2725ac0888a679d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "407061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6e9d4a78d0ad950ba0d2737",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘若自身位于中后方\\n则速度大幅提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e456abd4e4ef71bfaf86faf370126708c481bc56ba9d3a89767ea2db4d71310",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "407071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccaef09b631ca87756728948",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "附近有很多马娘时\\n速度大幅提升＜短距离/英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "dce5aee412b2a5a0883f3894bb6b7285365522290c1f3401ca2fbc7b02febe61",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "408011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cecd1f7983ced42123d255a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘在后方准备超越时\\n提升加速度,之后比赛进入最后200m时\\n速度稍微提升＜短距离/英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "765458c3b0661c7aafc9c73661e3cec82436560d51c701ae819391c186e832ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "408021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02c2aa6d0c75e6c6daed5cfc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘速度大幅提升\\n＜短距离/英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "6194262d9019b97037936f82bc1a215294e03bd874ed2083527d7e604afee10d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "408031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8496c57b830791336c77066f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在弯道处速度大幅提升\\n＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7d39fe004e968e72cfa9a0ba5f1d1975ca48e10e2bb5968f6f81e1a70e2fdde",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "408041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a404afdacad21abfe5a696bf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘加速度提升\\n之后比赛进入最后200m时\\n速度稍微提升＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "8138e628497fa5163d76cfe367810ee40db9be33faddeee077499fb5c413c858",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "408051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23794fad30b13ba8d19bb69c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在弯道处加速度提升\\n之后比赛进入最后200m时\\n速度稍微提升\\n＜短距离/英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e00c211d1ceca2dd7ccab021cb68468325a86478b9b04f6b370c85eff5bac12a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "408061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4038ac46e3ca7828c7aa4f5f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘位于领头或是距离领头4马身以内时\\n在终盘提升加速度,之后在最终直线\\n稍微提升速度＜先行・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "0727fab0989311450c147bab8312c8a5270ca1061b8f1d543d9cbc6ca81baef7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "409011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7127f26b5c86bbc3cce35e3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进入中盘直线时回复耐力\\n并小幅向前突进＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b519aac8cfa05043bafff9b7f48293168393c55b1774bb6a25a1ec5296757e5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "409021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a9464c4d3d011b088d6b833",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘一段时间内速度提升\\n并回复少量耐力＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "0be6f069c4639c0070de57ac4c9e498f58738495f11bdc93016bb144d3788bd0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "409031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df183529ea3906e56f580ef5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最后冲刺的关键阶段\\n速度大幅提升＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe37debeb2f06aea14d212a5f08443e75590b81343618ebe795e390a2800a1c0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "409041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:510cb86428ccf2a5b07e72bb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在2000m以上的比赛中\\n比赛序盘或中盘期间\\n被超越或进行竞争时将大幅提升速度\\n＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3d686de5de37e507843955b73bff1871fda711c03f6fe059481ea207c9c5093",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "409051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c69fd7493e8a8228b3cdd7e7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在弯道上速度大幅提升\\n＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "048d6607d93ab529daf5b330e75ba7e7849a25a5b077c0ccc47b5812609984bc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "409061"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
